---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import wholeLifeHome from '../assets/enrolment-whole-life-home.webp';
import wholeLifeCar from '../assets/enrolment-whole-life-car.webp';
import {url} from '../data/site';
const stages=[
 ['compass','See your child’s capabilities clearly','Assessment and AbilityScore® measurement help the team understand current abilities and agree where to begin.'],
 ['plan','Turn the life you want into a plan','Readiness forecasting and a child-specific plan connect priorities to everyday life.'],
 ['people','Make every intervention serve the direction','Appropriate therapies and intervention work around your child’s needs and goals.'],
 ['home','Carry developing abilities into daily life','Parent-guided practice helps bring the work into home and everyday routines.'],
 ['track','Look for change where life happens','Family observations and progress tracking inform review and changes to the plan.'],
 ['loop','Reassess. Refine. Keep working.','Reassessment guides the next priorities and support as readiness develops.'],
 ['sun','Grow toward a fuller life','Greater independence, school readiness and mainstream participation give the journey its purpose.']
];
---
<section class="section wrap enrol-journey" aria-labelledby="journey-title" id="your-childs-journey">
 <div class="enrol-section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The PinnacleAI® paradigm shift</p><h2 id="journey-title">Start with the whole life.<br/><em>Make every part serve it.</em></h2><p>An assessment, technique or therapy session matters most when it helps your child do more in real life. Pinnacle begins with the life you want your child to grow toward, then gives every ability, goal, method, person, practice and review a clear direction.</p><p>Pinnacle’s published analysis describes a field often organised around separate concerns and disciplines. The PinnacleAI approach responds by asking the larger question every day: <strong>how will this help this child grow toward greater independence and mainstream participation?</strong></p></div>
 <div class="enrol-analogy-band" role="group" aria-label="The whole-life analogy">
  <figure class="enrol-story-figure"><Image src={wholeLifeHome} widths={[480,720,1200]} sizes="(min-width:700px) 50vw, 100vw" width={1200} format="webp" quality={80} loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="A mother and child walking toward a home, illustrating how individual parts serve a whole life."/><figcaption><strong>Bricks matter. The home gives them purpose.</strong></figcaption></figure>
  <figure class="enrol-story-figure"><Image src={wholeLifeCar} widths={[480,720,1200]} sizes="(min-width:700px) 50vw, 100vw" width={1200} format="webp" quality={80} loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="A completed car beside individual components, illustrating how specialised work serves a shared purpose."/><figcaption><strong>Every part matters. The journey gives it direction.</strong></figcaption></figure>
  <p>Therapies and techniques are the parts. <strong>Your child’s life is the purpose.</strong></p>
 </div>
 <ol class="enrol-stages">{stages.map(([icon,title,body],i)=><li><div class="enrol-stage-top"><span class="enrol-step">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><Icon name={icon} size={30}/></div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p></li>)}</ol>
 <div class="enrol-family-role"><Icon name="heart" size={30}/><p><strong>You belong in every stage.</strong> Your priorities, observations and questions help shape the journey. Professionals guide care decisions; PinnacleAI supports the work.</p><a href={url('/verify/evidence/pinnacle-paradigm-shift.html')}>Explore the complete approach →</a></div>
 <aside class="enrol-history-note" aria-labelledby="paradigm-history-title"><h3 id="paradigm-history-title">Why Pinnacle calls this a paradigm shift</h3><p>Pinnacle’s published AbilityScore® monograph frames a 160-year historical challenge: valuable specialist assessments and techniques continued to grow, while families could still be left to connect the parts and ask what whole life they were building toward.</p><a href={url('/verify/evidence/pinnacle-paradigm-shift.html#the-historical-challenge')}>Read the historical argument and its source boundaries →</a></aside>
</section>
